-start justify-between gap-4"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-1">How Does Acupressure Compare to Massage?</h2><p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Comparing technique and benefits</p></div><span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 whitespace-nowrap">2026-05-12</span></div></a><a href="/basics/how-does-acupressure-work/" class="block border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-forest-400 dark:hover:border-forest-600 transition-colors bg-white dark:bg-stone-800/50"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-1">How Does Acupressure Work?</h2><p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">The science behind the practice</p></div><span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 whitespace-nowrap">2026-05-15</span></div></a></div>
  </div>

